# Frost -- cold, and a long way underground
#
# The opposite treatment to Ember: everything pulled towards ice, the
# warm families desaturated rather than removed. Cold enough that a torch
# flame or a pool of lava genuinely startles.

name    Frost
blurb   Deep winter. Bring a light source.

